<article class="panel recipe"><span class="eyebrow">15 minutes / One pan</span><h3>Tofu and bean skillet</h3><p>Crumble 200 g firm tofu into a hot pan with olive oil. Add ½ cup drained black beans, diced peppers, cumin, and smoked paprika. Cook until hot; serve over rice with lime.</p><p class="quiet">Protein ingredients: tofu and beans. Contains soy.</p></article>
